    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Search of The Golden Crops</strong>\u00a0is a short game about plant and harvest, use cards, sell your crops, complete tasks on board, upgrade your farm and collect all Golden Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on plants to crop them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/c925fd425ede7c7524856d07b9c51526.poster.avif?t=1735050291\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/c925fd425ede7c7524856d07b9c51526.webm?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/c925fd425ede7c7524856d07b9c51526.mp4?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your farm to improve your crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/e88251207cfeaa41d731c39185e1a081.poster.avif?t=1735050291\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/e88251207cfeaa41d731c39185e1a081.webm?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/e88251207cfeaa41d731c39185e1a081.mp4?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Task board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks on board to receive rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/14626298320bfc56cd6c49d2a68a3204.poster.avif?t=1735050291\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/14626298320bfc56cd6c49d2a68a3204.webm?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/14626298320bfc56cd6c49d2a68a3204.mp4?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new card packs on Store to plant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/14c16981e06b60b07144fe243a48a7dc.poster.avif?t=1735050291\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/14c16981e06b60b07144fe243a48a7dc.webm?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your crops on Market to earn money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/611d503ad920decc0d1cdb7e22fe11e0.poster.avif?t=1735050291\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/611d503ad920decc0d1cdb7e22fe11e0.webm?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270970/extras/611d503ad920decc0d1cdb7e22fe11e0.mp4?t=1735050291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And find all Golden Crops!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy-it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you have any questions, suggestions, or problems, send me an email at eltongamestudios@proton.me</i></p>",
